'''Furlbrow's Pumpkin Patch''' is one of the many farms in [[Westfall]] that has been taken over by the [[Defias Brotherhood]] and their mechanical [[harvest golem]]s. Now the killing machines patrol the fields and Defias have taken up residence in the buildings. [[Farmer Furlbrow]] and his wife [[Verna Furlbrow|Verna]] have fled and can be found on the road near the [[Jansen Stead]] in northern Westfall.

